<type>(<scope>): <short summary>

# Types:
#   feat      - new feature / data structure
#   fix       - bug fix
#   refactor  - code change without behavior change
#   test      - add or update tests
#   build     - build system / CMake changes
#   docs      - documentation only
#   chore     - repo maintenance, formatting, cleanup
#
# Scope (optional):
#   sequence, trees, hashing, graphs, build, tests, docs
#
# Rules:
# - Use imperative mood: "add", "fix", "refactor"
# - Keep summary under 72 characters
# - No period at the end
#
# Examples:
#   feat(sequence): add static_array container
#   build: add minimal CMakeLists for C++23
#   refactor(static_array): simplify iterator implementation
